# Vercel hosts ONLY the Flutter Web frontend. The Node/Express backend
# (server.js, package.json, ...) runs on Render and must never be uploaded
# here, or Vercel would try to run it as a serverless function.
#
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what `flutter build web`
# needs. This also keeps .env files, SQL backups and JSON data snapshots off
# Vercel when deploying with the Vercel CLI from this folder.
/*
!/lib
!/web
!/assets
!/pubspec.yaml
!/pubspec.lock
!/analysis_options.yaml
!/vercel.json
!/scripts
/scripts/*
!/scripts/vercel-build.sh
